  "body": "## What changed\nCorrect the gate-map headers for adaptive_fig8_crossing and shipped_from_disk.\nAdd two pins for the suites selected by verification and posting changes.\n\n## Cause\nThe fig8 header still named app::verify after verification moved to sim.\nThe shipped-file suite had no gate map.\nBoth errors broke the xtask gate-map law on main.\n\n## Tests\ncargo test -p xtask passed: 149 unit tests and 6 integration tests.\ncargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main passed all four steps.\ncargo clippy -p xtask -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings passed.\nPins: gate_maps_tests::sim_verify_change_selects_the_fig8_regression_suite and gate_maps_tests::posting_changes_select_the_shipped_from_disk_suite.\nBoth pins failed before the fix.\nRestoring each original header independently made its pin fail.\nRestoring each corrected header made its pin pass.\nThe existing no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app law also failed before the fix and passed after it.\n\n## Goldens moved\nNone.\n\n## Not exercised\nThe fig8 machining tests remain ignored in debug under their existing release-heavy rule.\ngraphify update could not run because graphify is not installed.\n\n## Overlaps\nNone found among open PRs for the changed files.\n\nProcess change: yes\nEffort: low\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #2307\n",
